-- ============================================================================
-- WC26 FAN VOTE — MIGRATION: seed the full cosmetics catalogue (144 items)
-- ============================================================================
-- The frontend (js/customization.js) generates 144 cosmetics from
-- CUST_TEAMS x WC26_THEMES x CUST_CATS. For ownership to PERSIST, every one of
-- them must exist as a row in public.cosmetics whose `code` matches the frontend
-- item id (e.g. 'France_nameplate_France', 'wc26_banner_NeonGoal'). The app maps
-- code -> uuid on load, calls buy_cosmetic(uuid) / equip_cosmetic(uuid), and
-- reads ownership back from public.user_cosmetics.
--
-- Idempotent: safe to re-run (on conflict (code) do nothing). Leaves the 6
-- example rows from the baseline schema untouched (their codes differ).
-- ============================================================================

on conflict (code) do nothing;
